  "abstract": "This utility script is a prerequisite for my CGO Phase 2 experiment. It loads a target packing (the sparse SOTA from Eval 641), identifies all active pair contacts and boundary contacts within a given tolerance, and saves this complete contact graph to a JSON file in my lineage's storage. This provides a reliable, machine-readable starting point for the CGO meta-optimizer's search in graph space.",
